{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Spectral Sonata is a first-person psychological horror game that immerses players in a hauntingly beautiful mansion. As you navigate its ever-changing corridors, you\u2019ll uncover the story of a prodigious musician whose soul is entwined with the very fabric of the estate and the horrors that happened there. Experience a chilling atmosphere where every creak and whisper adds to the tension, keeping you on edge throughout your journey.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3313430/extras/A_Dark__Shifting_Mansion.png?t=1746479422\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Navigate a grand, decaying mansion where no two visits are ever the same. Delve into the mansion\u2019s secrets, discovering hidden passages and unraveling the mysteries that lie within.<br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3313430/extras/ShiftingM.gif?t=1746479422\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3313430/extras/Uncover_The_Past.png?t=1746479422\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Piece together the musician\u2019s tragic story by finding scattered pages, notes and memories that bring the past back to life.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3313430/extras/Story.gif?t=1746479422\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3313430/extras/Eerie_Melody.png?t=1746479422\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The ghost\u2019s haunting melodies resonate through the mansion. Listen closely, as they may offer reassurance but may also foreshadow menace.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3313430/extras/Eerie.gif?t=1746479422\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3313430/extras/A_Haunting_Conclusion.png?t=1746479422\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Whether you escape or confront the ghost, the ending is altered by your understanding of her tragic past.<br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3313430/extras/ConclusionCropped.gif?t=1746479422\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Will you be able to free the musician\u2019s soul, or will you become another note in the mansion\u2019s haunting melody?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Key features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Immerse yourself in an atmospheric experience built on dread, tension, and emotional unease</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Explore the mansion which changes as you progress</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Piece together a haunting narrative through scattered notes, reading lost pages, and observing subtle environmental clues</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Listen closely to the music as the melodies guide, warn, and echo what\u2019s about to unfold</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A quiet, immersive narrative brought to life with haunting visuals, sparse dialogue, and a focus on atmosphere over exposition</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3313430?t=1746479422","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3313430?t=1746479422","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3313430/353efc86833fc7ea3d8d98058c877b8584d54035/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1746479422","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/